Subject: [OS-12 / HW-03] Reconcile incomplete CAMSS resource and graph merge

GPL-2.0-only, retaining upstream notices. Remove newer SoC resource blocks
whose enums, ops, regulator format and TPG interfaces are absent from this
Nabu driver. Preserve supported tables including SM8150. Complete the
fwnode endpoint conversion and count endpoints for notifier registration;
remove incomplete TPG allocation/probe fragments. Restore MSM8996 link callback.
Nabu camera behavior requires fresh physical validation.

